    "600 m - fastest": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 м - найхутчэй"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - màxima rapidesa"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - nejrychlejší"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - am schnellsten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - más rápido"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - hautes performances"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - सबसे तेज़"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - leggyorsabb"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - tercepat"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - più veloce"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - 最速"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 м - ең жылдам"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - 가장 빠름"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - terpantas"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - snelst"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - najszybciej"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - mais rápido"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - mais rápido"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 м - быстрее всего"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m – snabbast"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - เร็วที่สุด"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - pinakamabilis"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - en hızlı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 м - найшвидше"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - nhanh nhất"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - 最快"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"600 m - 最快"}}}},
    "8x MSAA": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MSAA 8x"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MSAA 8x"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MSAA 8x"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"8x MSAA"}}}},
    "A bus, a map, scenery, a whole OMSI folder - as a folder or a .zip, .7z or .rar. The original OMSI 2 folder is never written to.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Аўтобус, мапа, дэкарацыі, цэлая тэчка OMSI - тэчкамі або як .zip/.7z/.rar. У арыгінальную тэчку OMSI 2 нічога не запісваецца."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un autobús, un mapa, elements de l'entorn o una carpeta d'OMSI sencera, com a carpeta o fitxer .zip, .7z o .rar. La carpeta original d'OMSI 2 no es modifica mai."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autobus, mapa, scenérie, celá složka OMSI - jako složka nebo .zip/.7z/.rar. Do originální složky OMSI 2 se nikdy nezapisuje."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ein Bus, eine Karte, Szenerie, ein ganzer OMSI-Ordner - als Ordner oder .zip/.7z/.rar. In den originalen OMSI-2-Ordner wird nie geschrieben."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un autobús, un mapa, un escenario, una carpeta OMSI entera: como carpeta o como .zip/.7z/.rar. La carpeta del OMSI 2 original nunca se modifica."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un bus, une carte, des décors, tout un dossier OMSI - en dossier ou en .zip/.7z/.rar. Le dossier original OMSI 2 n'est jamais modifié."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"एक बस, मैप, दृश्य, या पूरा OMSI फ़ोल्डर - फ़ोल्डर या .zip/.7z/.rar के रूप में। ओरिजिनल OMSI 2 फ़ोल्डर में कभी कुछ नहीं लिखा जाता।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Busz, térkép, objektumok, egy teljes OMSI mappa - mappaként vagy .zip/.7z/.rar fájlként. Az eredeti OMSI 2 mappád érintetlen marad."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tambahkan bus, peta, objek, atau seluruh folder OMSI sebagai folder atau .zip/.7z/.rar. Folder OMSI 2 asli tidak pernah ditulis."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un bus, una mappa, uno scenario, un'intera cartella OMSI - come cartella o .zip/.7z/.rar. La cartella dell'OMSI 2 originale non viene mai modificata."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"バス、マップ、風景、OMSIフォルダ丸ごと - フォルダまたは.zip/.7z/.rarで。元のOMSI 2フォルダには一切書き込みません。"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Автобус, карта, декорация, тұтас OMSI қалтасы - қалта немесе .zip/.7z/.rar ретінде. Түпнұсқа OMSI 2 қалтасына ешқашан жазылмайды."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"버스, 지도, 오브젝트 또는 전체 OMSI 폴더를 폴더나 .zip/.7z/.rar로 추가할 수 있습니다. 원본 OMSI 2 폴더에는 절대 쓰지 않습니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tambah bas, peta, objek atau seluruh folder OMSI sebagai folder atau .zip/.7z/.rar. Folder OMSI 2 asal tidak pernah ditulis."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Een bus, een kaart, een landschap, een hele OMSI-map - als map of .zip/.7z/.rar. In de map van de originele OMSI 2 wordt nooit geschreven."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autobus, mapa, sceneria, cały folder OMSI - jako folder lub .zip/.7z/.rar. Do oryginalnego folderu OMSI 2 nic nie jest zapisywane."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Um ônibus, um mapa, um cenário, uma pasta OMSI inteira: como pasta ou como .zip/.7z/.rar. A pasta do OMSI 2 original nunca é alterada."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Um autocarro, um mapa, um cenário, uma pasta OMSI inteira: como pasta ou como .zip/.7z/.rar. A pasta do OMSI 2 original nunca é alterada."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Автобус, карта, объекты, целая папка OMSI - папкой или .zip/.7z/.rar. В папку оригинальной OMSI 2 ничего не пишется."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En buss, en karta, landskapsobjekt, en hel OMSI-mapp – som mapp eller .zip, .7z eller .rar. Den ursprungliga OMSI 2-mappen ändras aldrig."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เพิ่มรถบัส แผนที่ ฉาก หรือโฟลเดอร์ OMSI ทั้งชุดได้ทั้งแบบโฟลเดอร์หรือ .zip/.7z/.rar โดยจะไม่เขียนลงในโฟลเดอร์ OMSI 2 ต้นฉบับ"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Magdagdag ng bus, mapa, scenery, o buong OMSI folder bilang folder o .zip/.7z/.rar. Hindi susulatan ang orihinal na OMSI 2 folder."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bir otobüs, harita, manzara, tüm bir OMSI klasörü - klasör veya .zip/.7z/.rar olarak. Orijinal OMSI 2 klasörüne asla yazılmaz."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Автобус, мапа, декорації, ціла тека OMSI - теками або як .zip/.7z/.rar. В оригінальну теку OMSI 2 нічого не записується."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thêm xe buýt, bản đồ, cảnh quan hoặc cả thư mục OMSI dưới dạng thư mục hoặc .zip/.7z/.rar. Không bao giờ ghi vào thư mục OMSI 2 gốc."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"巴士、地图、场景、整个OMSI文件夹--以文件夹或.zip/.7z/.rar形式。绝不会写入原版OMSI 2文件夹。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"巴士、地圖、景觀、整個 OMSI 資料夾--可為資料夾或 .zip/.7z/.rar 格式。絕不會寫入原版 OMSI 2 資料夾。"}}}},
