    "Free drive": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Свабодная язда"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conducció lliure"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volná jízda"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Freie Fahrt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conducción libre"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conduite freeroam"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"फ़्री ड्राइव"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Szabad vezetés"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mengemudi bebas"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Guida libera"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"フリードライブ"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Еркін жүру"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"자유 운전"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pemanduan bebas"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vrij rijden"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jazda swobodna"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Direção livre"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Condução livre"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Свободная езда"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fri körning"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ขับอิสระ"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Malayang pagmamaneho"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Serbest sürüş"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вільна поїздка"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lái tự do"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自由驾驶"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自由駕駛"}}}},
    "Free driving: the bus starts where you chose, with the traffic and the timetable's buses around it, but no line of your own.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Свабодная язда: аўтобус стартуе там, дзе вы абралі, з рухам і аўтобусамі па раскладзе вакол, але без уласнай лініі."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conducció lliure: l'autobús comença on has triat, amb el trànsit i els autobusos programats al voltant, però sense línia pròpia."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volná jízda: autobus začne na vybraném místě, kolem něj je provoz a autobusy podle jízdního řádu, ale žádná vlastní linka."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Freie Fahrt: der Bus startet am gewählten Ort, mit Verkehr und Fahrplanbussen, aber ohne eigene Linie."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conducción libre: el autobús empieza donde elijas, con el tráfico y los autobuses del horario a su alrededor, pero sin línea propia."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conduite libre : le bus part où vous l'avez choisi, avec la circulation et les bus du réseau, mais sans ligne attitrée."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"फ़्री ड्राइविंग: बस आपकी चुनी जगह से शुरू होती है, आसपास ट्रैफ़िक और टाइमटेबल की बसें होती हैं, लेकिन आपकी अपनी कोई लाइन नहीं होती।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Szabad vezetés: a busz a választott helyen indul, körülötte forgalommal és menetrend szerinti buszokkal, de aktív menetrend nélkül."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mengemudi bebas: bus mulai dari lokasi pilihan Anda dengan lalu lintas dan bus terjadwal, tetapi tanpa rute Anda sendiri."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Guida libera: il bus parte dove hai scelto, con il traffico e i bus di linea intorno, ma senza una linea tua."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"フリードライブ:選んだ場所からバスが出発します。周囲には一般車両と時刻表のバスが走りますが、専用の系統はありません。"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Еркін жүру: автобус сіз таңдаған жерден бастайды, айналада қозғалыс пен кестелік автобустар жүреді, бірақ өз желіңіз болмайды."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"자유 운전: 선택한 위치에서 출발하며 주변에 교통과 시간표 버스가 있지만 본인 노선은 없습니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pemanduan bebas: bas bermula di lokasi pilihan, dengan trafik dan bas berjadual di sekeliling, tetapi tanpa laluan sendiri."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vrij rijden: de bus start waar je kiest, met verkeer en dienstbussen eromheen, maar zonder eigen lijn."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jazda swobodna: autobus startuje tam, gdzie wybierzesz, wśród ruchu i autobusów rozkładowych, ale bez własnej linii."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Direção livre: o ônibus começa no local escolhido, com o trânsito e os ônibus do horário ao redor, mas sem uma linha própria."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Condução livre: o autocarro começa no local escolhido, com o trânsito e os autocarros do horário à volta, mas sem uma linha própria."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Свободная езда: автобус начинает там, где вы выбрали, вокруг движение и автобусы по расписанию, но без своего маршрута."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fri körning: bussen startar där du valt, med trafik och tidtabellsbussar runt omkring, men utan en egen linje."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ขับอิสระ: รถเริ่มจากจุดที่เลือก มีรถอื่นและรถตามตารางเวลาอยู่รอบ ๆ แต่ไม่มีสายรถของคุณเอง"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Malayang pagmamaneho: magsisimula ang bus sa napili mong lugar, may trapiko at mga naka-iskedyul na bus, pero wala kang sariling ruta."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Serbest sürüş: otobüs seçtiğiniz yerden başlar, çevresinde trafik ve tarifedeki otobüsler bulunur, ancak kendinize ait bir hat yoktur."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Вільна поїздка: автобус стартує там, де ви вибрали, з рухом і автобусами за розкладом навколо, але без власної лінії."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lái tự do: xe bắt đầu tại vị trí đã chọn, xung quanh vẫn có xe cộ và xe theo lịch trình, nhưng bạn không có tuyến riêng."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自由驾驶:巴士从你选择的位置出发,周围有交通车辆和时刻表巴士,但没有属于自己的线路。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自由駕駛：巴士會在你選定的位置出發，周圍仍有交通及按時間表運行的巴士，但你不會獲編配路線。"}}}},
