    "No mod matches.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Няма адпаведных модаў."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cap mod coincideix."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Žádný mód neodpovídá."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kein Mod passt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ningún mod coincide."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aucun mod ne correspond."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कोई मॉड मेल नहीं खाता।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nincs megfelelő mod."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tidak ada mod yang cocok."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nessuna mod corrisponde."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一致する MOD はありません。"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сәйкес мод жоқ."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"일치하는 모드가 없습니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tiada mod yang sepadan."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geen mod komt overeen."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Żaden mod nie pasuje."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nenhum mod corresponde."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nenhum mod corresponde."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ни один мод не подходит."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ingen modd matchar."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ไม่มีม็อดที่ตรงกัน"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Walang tugmang mod."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eşleşen mod yok."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Немає відповідних модів."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Không có mod nào khớp."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"没有匹配的模组。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有符合的模組。"}}}},
    "No runs yet. Drive a duty and it shows up here.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Паездак яшчэ няма. Праедзьце наряд, і ён з'явіцца тут."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Encara no hi ha serveis. Fes-ne un i apareixerà aquí."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatím žádné jízdy. Odjeďte službu a objeví se tady."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Noch keine Fahrten. Fahre einen Dienst, dann erscheint er hier."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no hay recorridos. Conduce un servicio y aparecerá aquí."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aucun service pour l'instant. Faites un service et il apparaîtra ici."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अभी कोई रन नहीं। कोई ड्यूटी चलाएँ, वह यहाँ दिखेगी।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Még nincs korábbi menet. Teljesíts egy szolgálatot, és itt megjelenik."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Belum ada perjalanan. Jalankan satu tugas untuk melihatnya di sini."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ancora nessuna corsa. Guida un turno e comparirà qui."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"運行記録はまだありません。乗務を運転するとここに表示されます。"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Әзірге рейстер жоқ. Нарядпен жүріңіз, ол осында пайда болады."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아직 운행 기록이 없습니다. 근무를 완료하면 여기에 표시됩니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Belum ada perjalanan. Pandu satu tugas untuk melihatnya di sini."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nog geen ritten. Rijd een dienst en die verschijnt hier."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Brak przejazdów. Odbądź służbę, a pojawi się tutaj."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ainda não há viagens. Faça uma escala e ela aparecerá aqui."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ainda não há viagens. Faça uma escala e ela aparecerá aqui."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Поездок пока нет. Отработайте смену - она появится здесь."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inga körningar ännu. Kör en tjänst så visas den här."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ยังไม่มีประวัติการขับรถ เริ่มหน้าที่แล้วข้อมูลจะปรากฏที่นี่"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wala pang biyahe. Magmaneho ng isang duty para lumitaw rito."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Henüz sefer yok. Bir görev sürün, burada görünür."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Поїздок ще немає. Проїдьте наряд, і він з'явиться тут."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chưa có chuyến nào. Lái một ca để hiển thị tại đây."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"还没有行车记录。完成一次出车任务后会显示在这里。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚無行車記錄。完成一個更次後便會顯示在此。"}}}},
    "No saved profiles": {"localizations":{"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sense perfils desats"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keine gespeicherten Profile"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aucun profil enregistré"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geen opgeslagen profielen"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nenhum perfil salvo"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nenhum perfil guardado"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inga sparade profiler"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"没有保存的配置文件"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有儲存的設定檔"}}}},
    "No servers yet. Add a server by the address its owner gives you.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сервераў яшчэ няма. Дадайце сервер па адрасе, які дасць яго ўладальнік."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Encara no hi ha servidors. Afegeix-ne un amb l'adreça que et doni el propietari."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatím žádné servery. Přidejte server podle adresy od jeho majitele."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Noch keine Server. Füge einen Server mit der Adresse hinzu, die dir sein Besitzer gibt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no hay servidores. Añade un servidor con la dirección que te dé su dueño."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aucun serveur pour l'instant. Ajoutez un serveur avec l'adresse donnée par son propriétaire."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अभी कोई सर्वर नहीं। मालिक के दिए पते से सर्वर जोड़ें।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Még nincs szerver. Adj hozzá egy szervert a tulajdonosa által adott címmel."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Belum ada server. Tambahkan alamat dari pemiliknya."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ancora nessun server. Aggiungi un server con l'indirizzo che ti dà il proprietario."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"サーバーはまだありません。所有者から教えられたアドレスでサーバーを追加してください。"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Серверлер әлі жоқ. Иесі берген мекенжай бойынша сервер қосыңыз."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아직 서버가 없습니다. 소유자가 제공한 주소로 추가하세요."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Belum ada pelayan. Tambah alamat yang diberikan pemiliknya."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nog geen servers. Voeg een server toe met het adres dat de eigenaar je geeft."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Brak serwerów. Dodaj serwer według adresu podanego przez właściciela."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ainda não há servidores. Adicione um servidor com o endereço que o dono fornecer."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ainda não há servidores. Adicione um servidor com o endereço que o dono fornecer."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Серверов пока нет. Добавьте сервер по адресу, который даст его владелец."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inga servrar ännu. Lägg till en server med adressen som ägaren ger dig."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ยังไม่มีเซิร์ฟเวอร์ เพิ่มจากที่อยู่ที่เจ้าของให้มา"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wala pang server. Idagdag ang address na ibinigay ng owner."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Henüz sunucu yok. Sahibinin verdiği adresle bir sunucu ekleyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Серверів ще немає. Додайте сервер за адресою, яку дасть його власник."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chưa có máy chủ. Thêm địa chỉ do chủ máy chủ cung cấp."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"还没有服务器。请通过其所有者提供的地址添加服务器。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未加入伺服器。請輸入伺服器擁有者提供的地址。"}}}},
