    "not on this day": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"не ў гэты дзень"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"no aquest dia"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ne v tento den"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"nicht an diesem Tag"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"no este día"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"pas ce jour-là"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस दिन नहीं"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ezen a napon nem"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"tidak pada hari ini"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"non in questo giorno"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この日はなし"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"бұл күні емес"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 날은 없음"}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"bukan pada hari ini"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"niet op deze dag"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"nie w tym dniu"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"não neste dia"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"não neste dia"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"не в этот день"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"inte denna dag"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ไม่มีในวันนี้"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"hindi sa araw na ito"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"bu gün değil"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"не цього дня"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"không chạy ngày này"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当天不运行"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當天不行駛"}}}},
    "openOMSI": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI"}}}},
    "openOMSI needs the whole OMSI 2 folder of your computer: the one with Omsi.exe, maps and Vehicles in it.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI патрэбна ўся тэчка OMSI 2 з вашага камп'ютара: тая, дзе ляжаць Omsi.exe, maps і Vehicles."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI necessita la carpeta sencera d'OMSI 2 del teu ordinador: la que conté Omsi.exe, maps i Vehicles."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI potřebuje celou složku OMSI 2 z vašeho počítače: tu, ve které jsou Omsi.exe, maps a Vehicles."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI braucht den ganzen OMSI-2-Ordner deines Computers: den mit Omsi.exe, maps und Vehicles darin."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI necesita la carpeta completa de OMSI 2 de tu ordenador: la que contiene Omsi.exe, maps y Vehicles."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI a besoin du dossier OMSI 2 complet de votre ordinateur : celui qui contient Omsi.exe, maps et Vehicles."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI को आपके कंप्यूटर का पूरा OMSI 2 फ़ोल्डर चाहिए: वही जिसमें Omsi.exe, maps और Vehicles हों।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Az openOMSI-nak a számítógéped teljes OMSI 2 mappája kell: az, amelyben az Omsi.exe, a maps és a Vehicles található."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI memerlukan seluruh folder OMSI 2 dari komputer Anda: folder yang berisi Omsi.exe, maps, dan Vehicles."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI ha bisogno dell'intera cartella di OMSI 2 del tuo computer: quella che contiene Omsi.exe, maps e Vehicles."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSIにはパソコンのOMSI 2フォルダ全体が必要です。Omsi.exe、maps、Vehiclesが入っているフォルダです。"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI-ге компьютеріңіздегі OMSI 2 қалтасы толығымен керек: ішінде Omsi.exe, maps және Vehicles бар қалта."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI에는 컴퓨터의 OMSI 2 폴더 전체가 필요합니다. Omsi.exe, maps, Vehicles가 들어 있는 폴더입니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI memerlukan keseluruhan folder OMSI 2 daripada komputer anda: folder yang mengandungi Omsi.exe, maps dan Vehicles."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI heeft de hele OMSI 2-map van je computer nodig: die met Omsi.exe, maps en Vehicles erin."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI potrzebuje całego folderu OMSI 2 z twojego komputera: tego, w którym są Omsi.exe, maps i Vehicles."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O openOMSI precisa da pasta inteira do OMSI 2 do seu computador: aquela com Omsi.exe, maps e Vehicles dentro."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O openOMSI precisa da pasta completa do OMSI 2 do seu computador: a que contém Omsi.exe, maps e Vehicles."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI нужна вся папка OMSI 2 с вашего компьютера: та, в которой лежат Omsi.exe, maps и Vehicles."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI behöver hela OMSI 2-mappen från din dator: den med Omsi.exe, maps och Vehicles i."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI ต้องใช้โฟลเดอร์ OMSI 2 ทั้งโฟลเดอร์จากคอมพิวเตอร์ของคุณ คือโฟลเดอร์ที่มี Omsi.exe, maps และ Vehicles"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kailangan ng openOMSI ang buong OMSI 2 folder ng iyong computer: ang may Omsi.exe, maps at Vehicles."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI'nin bilgisayarınızdaki OMSI 2 klasörünün tamamına ihtiyacı var: içinde Omsi.exe, maps ve Vehicles bulunan klasör."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI потрібна вся тека OMSI 2 з вашого комп'ютера: та, у якій є Omsi.exe, maps і Vehicles."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI cần toàn bộ thư mục OMSI 2 trên máy tính của bạn: thư mục chứa Omsi.exe, maps và Vehicles."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI需要电脑上完整的OMSI 2文件夹：即包含Omsi.exe、maps和Vehicles的那个。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI 需要電腦上完整的 OMSI 2 資料夾：也就是包含 Omsi.exe、maps 及 Vehicles 的那個。"}}}},
    "openOMSI plays the content of an OMSI 2 installation: the original game must be installed (Steam or another copy).": {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI spielt die Inhalte einer OMSI-2-Installation: Das Originalspiel muss installiert sein (Steam oder eine andere Kopie)."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI использует контент установленной OMSI 2: оригинальная игра должна быть установлена (Steam или другая копия)."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI använder innehållet från en OMSI 2-installation: originalspelet måste vara installerat (Steam eller annan kopia)."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI 使用 OMSI 2 的內容：必須先安裝原版遊戲（Steam 或其他版本）。"}}}},
    "openOMSI plays the content of your own copy of OMSI 2 (Steam or another copy): the game itself is not included.": {"localizations":{"be":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI выкарыстоўвае змесціва вашай уласнай копіі OMSI 2 (Steam або іншай): самой гульні ў камплекце няма."}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI fa servir el contingut de la teva pròpia còpia d'OMSI 2 (de Steam o una altra): el joc en si no s'hi inclou."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI používá obsah vaší vlastní kopie OMSI 2 (Steam nebo jiná kopie): samotná hra není součástí aplikace."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI nutzt die Inhalte deiner eigenen Kopie von OMSI 2 (Steam oder eine andere): Das Spiel selbst ist nicht enthalten."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI usa el contenido de tu propia copia de OMSI 2 (de Steam u otra): el juego en sí no está incluido."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI utilise le contenu de votre propre copie d'OMSI 2 (Steam ou autre) : le jeu lui-même n'est pas inclus."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI आपकी अपनी OMSI 2 कॉपी (Steam या कोई और कॉपी) का कंटेंट चलाता है: गेम खुद इसमें शामिल नहीं है।"}},"hu":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Az openOMSI a saját OMSI 2 példányod tartalmát használja (Steam vagy más példány): maga a játék nincs benne."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI menjalankan konten dari salinan OMSI 2 milik Anda sendiri (Steam atau salinan lain): gamenya sendiri tidak disertakan."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI usa i contenuti della tua copia di OMSI 2 (Steam o un'altra): il gioco in sé non è incluso."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSIはお持ちのOMSI 2（Steam版など）のコンテンツで動作します。ゲーム本体は含まれていません。"}},"kk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI өзіңіздегі OMSI 2 көшірмесінің мазмұнын пайдаланады (Steam немесе басқа көшірме): ойынның өзі құрамына кірмейді."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI는 사용자가 보유한 OMSI 2(Steam 또는 다른 버전)의 콘텐츠로 실행됩니다. 게임 자체는 포함되어 있지 않습니다."}},"ms":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI memainkan kandungan salinan OMSI 2 anda sendiri (Steam atau salinan lain): permainan itu sendiri tidak disertakan."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI gebruikt de inhoud van je eigen exemplaar van OMSI 2 (Steam of een ander exemplaar): het spel zelf zit er niet bij."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI korzysta z zawartości twojej własnej kopii OMSI 2 (Steam lub inna kopia): sama gra nie jest dołączona."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O openOMSI roda o conteúdo da sua própria cópia do OMSI 2 (Steam ou outra): o jogo em si não está incluído."}},"pt-PT":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O openOMSI executa o conteúdo da sua própria cópia do OMSI 2 (Steam ou outra): o jogo em si não está incluído."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI использует контент вашей собственной копии OMSI 2 (Steam или другой): сама игра не входит в комплект."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI använder innehållet från ditt eget exemplar av OMSI 2 (Steam eller ett annat): själva spelet ingår inte."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI ใช้เนื้อหาจาก OMSI 2 ที่คุณมีอยู่เอง (Steam หรือแหล่งอื่น) ตัวเกมไม่ได้รวมมาด้วย"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pinapatakbo ng openOMSI ang content ng sarili mong kopya ng OMSI 2 (Steam o ibang kopya): hindi kasama ang mismong laro."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI, kendi OMSI 2 kopyanızın içeriğini kullanır (Steam veya başka bir kopya): oyunun kendisi dahil değildir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI використовує вміст вашої власної копії OMSI 2 (Steam чи іншої): саму гру не включено."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI chạy nội dung từ bản OMSI 2 của chính bạn (Steam hoặc bản khác): không bao gồm trò chơi."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI运行的是你自己的OMSI 2副本（Steam版或其他版本）中的内容：不包含游戏本身。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"openOMSI 執行的是你自己的 OMSI 2（Steam 版或其他版本）中的內容：不包含遊戲本體。"}}}},
